<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-19" title="Influencer requirements" summary="Influencer banne se pehle yeh zaroori shartein padhein." review={true} related={[{ href: '/hosts/rules', label: 'Influencer rules' }, { href: '/hosts/agreement', label: 'Influencer agreement' }]}>
<h2>Who can join as an influencer?</h2><ul><li>You must be at least 18 and an Indian resident.</li><li>Use your own phone number and one account per person.</li><li>Only you may take calls on your account. Do not share or rent it.</li><li>Go live in one of two ways. Connect a channel (20 or more followers, and 1,000 or more views on YouTube): sign in with YouTube, or put a short code in your Instagram bio. Or do a video KYC (Aadhaar and a short selfie video). You can have both.</li><li>No channel? Individuals are welcome: chat, keep company, share your day. Sexual or adult talk is never allowed.</li><li>A Women-only or LGBTQ+ channel needs video KYC.</li><li>You can choose to take calls only from video-KYC customers. It is free for every creator. We never share any customer&rsquo;s details with anyone.</li><li>We check your UPI once, before your first withdrawal.</li></ul>
<h2>Conversation, without professional claims</h2><p>Do not present yourself on {BRAND.name} as a doctor, lawyer, counsellor, chartered accountant or financial advisor. Do not give medical, legal, financial or other regulated advice, even if you hold a qualification outside the platform.</p>
<p>Give honest profile details. Keep your account details up to date.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
